Hi LC - glad I could help.

I was asking these questions myself elsewhere in 2013. Here is Roger Bivands solution about how to achieve this - he explains it better than I can:
https://stat.ethz.ch/pipermail/r-sig-geo/2013-July/018864.html

You can code specific edits to nb matrices but it is tricky! Not for the faint hearted! I don't recommend it unless you absolutely have to do it. Rogers solutions should work fine for your problem though assuming your islands are made up of one single area (which they should be given the description of your problem).

James

